  "historyNote": "#4873, eff 07-24-90; ss by #6297, eff 7-23-96; ss by #8122, INTERIM, eff 7-17-04, EXPIRES: 1-13-05; ss and moved by #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1306.06); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24 (formerly Saf-C 1307.06), EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (formerly Saf-C 1307.06) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
